<title>GERMANY: Fresenius H1 net profit up 119 pct.</title>
<headline>Fresenius H1 net profit up 119 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OBERURSEL, Germany 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   116     vs 53</p>
<p>Group earnings before interest and</p>
<p>    tax					    337     vs 98</p>
<p>    Group pretax profit			217     up 155 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German medical products group is Fresenius AG. The company said the steep sales rise was due to the incorporation of National Medical Care as well as acquisitions in the drugs and intensive care and diagnostics divisions.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
